															<img decoding="async" width="1200" height="800" src="/wp-content/uploads/ALTER-25.jpg" class="attachment-large size-large wp-image-112265" alt="" srcset="/wp-content/uploads/ALTER-25-100x100.jpg 100w, /wp-content/uploads/ALTER-25-150x100.jpg 150w, /wp-content/uploads/ALTER-25-300x200.jpg 300w, /wp-content/uploads/ALTER-25-380x253.jpg 380w, /wp-content/uploads/ALTER-25-480x320.jpg 480w, /wp-content/uploads/ALTER-25-600x400.jpg 600w, /wp-content/uploads/ALTER-25-640x427.jpg 640w, /wp-content/uploads/ALTER-25-768x512.jpg 768w, /wp-content/uploads/ALTER-25-800x533.jpg 800w, /wp-content/uploads/ALTER-25-1024x683.jpg 1024w, /wp-content/uploads/ALTER-25.jpg 1200w" sizes="(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" />															</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-6b4eb03 elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-content" data-id="6b4eb03" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="theme-post-content.default">
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Indoor water fountains are a great way to create a welcoming and relaxing environment for customers and employees. The sound of flowing water can help to mask unwanted noise and create a sense of peace and tranquillity. Indoor water fountains can also be visually appealing, adding a touch of elegance and sophistication to any space. For commercial buildings, they make a great choice for the reasons above.</p>
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Since 1977, Midwest Tropical has been at the forefront of designing and manufacturing custom <a href="/bubble-walls/">water features</a> for commercial clients and continues to evolve and progress in our services. In this blog, we will be discussing how you can create a welcoming and warm environment in your building for your customers and employees. However, before choosing an indoor water fountain for your building, there are a few things to keep in mind.</p>
<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Size and placement.</strong></p>
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Choose a fountain that is the right size for your space. You don’t want a fountain that is too large and overwhelming, or too small and insignificant. Consider the placement of the fountain as well. You don’t want to place it in a high-traffic area where people are likely to trip over it or in a corner where it will be hidden from view.</p>
<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Style.</strong></p>
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">There are many different styles of indoor water fountains available, from classic to contemporary. Choose a fountain that complements the décor of your commercial property.</p>
<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Features.</strong></p>
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Some indoor water fountains come with additional features, such as LED lights, Bluetooth speakers, and even aromatherapy. Consider which features are important to you, and choose a fountain that has them.</p>
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Once you have chosen an indoor water fountain, it is important to maintain it properly. This will help to keep it looking and running at its best. Be sure to clean the fountain regularly and change the water frequently.</p>
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Now, let’s look at some of the ways you can use an <a href="/indoor-water-fountains/">indoor water fountain</a> to create a welcoming environment for customers and employees.</p>
<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li>Place the fountain in a central location where it can be seen and heard by everyone. This will help to create a sense of unity and community.</li>
<li>Choose a fountain with a calming sound. The sound of rushing water can be too overwhelming in a commercial setting. Instead, choose a fountain with a gentle trickle or babbling sound. Or, you can use the fountain to mask unwanted noise. The sound of flowing water can help to cover up noise from traffic, construction, or other sources.</li>
<li>Add some plants or flowers around the fountain. This will help to create a more natural and inviting atmosphere.</li>
<li>You can improve air quality by installing a <a href="/indoor-water-fountains/">water fountain indoor</a>. The water in the fountain can help to trap dust and other pollutants, making the air cleaner and more pleasant to breathe.</li>
<li>Use the fountain to promote relaxation and well-being. The sound of flowing water can be very calming and soothing. It can help to reduce stress and anxiety and improve mood and overall well-being.</li>
<li>You can also use the fountain to promote your brand or values. You can do this by adding your company logo to the fountain or by choosing a fountain that reflects your company’s branding. The possibilities are endless.</li>
</ul>
<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>Let’s Wrap Up.</strong></p>
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Indoor water fountains are a great way to create a welcoming and relaxing environment for customers and employees. By following these tips, you can choose and use the right fountain to create the desired effect. If you are looking for a custom water feature, feel free to reach out to us. We at Midwest Tropical are here to ensure your building gets the indoor water fountain that compliments it tenfold.</p>
